ROCK_CHOIR_FINAL_CHORUS_8 → ROCK_CHOIR_HOOK ROCK_CHOIR_ANSWER ROCK_CHOIR_HOOK_HIGH ROCK_CHOIR_RING ROCK_CHOIR_TAG ROCK_CHOIR_TAG2 ROCK_CHOIR_AUTH ROCK_CHOIR_FINAL
